# Secrets and local configuration must never enter a Docker build context:
# file-based docker compose secrets (infrastructure/docker/secrets/), the local
# .env (and any environment copy), and the runtime OPA authz-token data dir.
# Safe templates (.env.example, secrets.example/) stay included — they are docs.
**/secrets/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/policies-data/
**/maven-cp.txt
*.dump
*.bak
infrastructure/docker/.p3tmp
infrastructure/docker/_p3tmp
**/.p3tmp/
**/_p3tmp/
infrastructure/docker/backups/
**/backups/
!**/.env.example
!**/secrets.example/
!**/secrets.example